SUMMARY:Energetic Experiences Closing Ceremony
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nJoin us as we gather in community to hono
 r\, celebrate\, and release the Energetic Experiences venue.\n\nFor 15 mon
 ths\, this space has held transformation\, connection\, and countless mean
 ingful moments. Together\, we will ceremoniously close this chapter by rel
 easing the physical container that has supported our shared journey.\n\nTh
 is will be a heart-centered\, community-led experience where all are welco
 me to share reflections\, memories\, and gratitude. Through guided element
 al rituals\, we will consciously move energy\, creating space for what is 
 next.\n\nFacilitators from our community will be present to support this s
 acred transition through offerings including a water release ritual\, fire
  wish ritual\, sound meditations\, altar roses\, and spoken blessings.\n\n
 Come as you are. This is open to all. Let’s close this chapter with inte
 ntion\, reverence\, and love.\n\nDonations welcome.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/awakeningasheville/events/314380610/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260420T135036Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260420T135036Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
