SUMMARY:Your Meditation journey continued....
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nEvery Tuesdays\, 7pm-8:15pm (EST) by Inst
 ructor Abhay\n\nDear Meditators\n\nBelow is the information for the upcomi
 ng meetings you can join to enhance your meditative journey with Sahaja Yo
 ga meditation. Our classes are always free.\n\nThe upcoming sessions can b
 e joined on a continuous basis to deepen and strengthen your meditation an
 d cleanse any blockages.
